    {
      "kind": "ability",
      "name": "Breath of Sand",
      "actions": 2,
      "category": "offensive",
      "traits": [
        "concentrate",
        "divine",
        "earth",
        "void"
      ],
      "text": "Requirements The prophet's Sandstorm is active\n\n---\n\nEffect The prophet inhales its Sandstorm, suppressing the effect until the end of the prophet's next turn. It then exhales a 120-foot cone of negatively charged sand that deals 7d6 void and 7d6 slashing damage (DC 33 basic Reflex save)."
    },
    {
      "kind": "ability",
      "name": "Channel Rot",
      "category": "offensive",
      "traits": [
        "divine"
      ],
      "text": "The mummy prophet of Set can deliver devastating rot through melee weapons they wield."
    },
    {
      "kind": "ability",
      "name": "Sand Form",
      "actions": 2,
      "category": "offensive",
      "traits": [
        "concentrate",
        "divine",
        "earth",
        "polymorph"
      ],
      "text": "Frequency once per day\n\n---\nEffect The prophet loses their coherent from and becomes an animated pile of sand. While in this form, the prophet gains resistance 10 to physical damage and is immune to precision damage. They can't cast spells, activate items, or use actions that have the attack or manipulate trait. They gain a fly Speed of 40 feet and can slip through tiny cracks. This lasts for 5 minutes, and the prophet can Dismiss the effect.",
      "frequency": {
        "max": 1,
        "per": "day"
      },
      "rules": [
        {
          "key": "roll-option",
          "option": "sand-form",
          "toggleable": true
        },
        {
